WEBVTT

00:01:27.291 --> 00:01:32.255
the permitting process that gives
polluters permission to pollute

00:01:32.296 --> 00:01:37.093
within a regulatory standard
for air, water and soil.

00:01:37.426 --> 00:01:38.970
Now, these permits,

00:01:39.011 --> 00:01:43.516
they are an allowance that sacrifices
the health of community residents.

00:01:43.558 --> 00:01:48.479
The cumulative effect of multiple
facilities sited in a community

00:01:48.479 --> 00:01:53.526
that emit high levels of pollution
in close proximity to where people live.

00:01:54.110 --> 00:01:57.363
That contributes to glaring
health disparities.

00:01:57.738 --> 00:02:00.867
Now, Harvard University studies
among Black Americans